The gorp binary embeds a static embedding table derived from the model
"static-retrieval-mrl-en-v1" published by the Sentence Transformers project
(https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/static-retrieval-mrl-en-v1),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The table is compiled into the
binary at build time; no model files are downloaded or installed at runtime.
